    "body": "## Integration scope\n\nContinues the existing PR #456 from current `main@b9a5792128059197bf6cae364876750493765cd8`. It integrates the exact reviewed source heads from PRs #449, #450, #451, and #454. The source PRs remain open and unchanged.\n\n- #449: `de6a6130622097d7123b3f4d6ce2da18bea1d9d3`\n- #450: `6cb4c5886f49e94240ed0b4ba133c151bc205eae`\n- #451: `8c42352136c8ded7d72cb87fac156f916e58cf1c`\n- #454: `a0c1fcd564498e12c204c68aed3420e3e701f445`\n\nFour two-parent merge commits preserve each source PR HEAD as the second parent. A normal merge commit brings #459/current main into this branch; the cumulative diff is 23 Chat03 paths, 53 commits ahead and 0 behind current main.\n\n## Integration reconciliations\n\n- `.github/workflows/chat03b2-private-api.yml` checks Worker, local harness, and remote-client syntax; runs both client regression suites, offline hosted-D1 safety, and local Worker/workerd/D1 integration. The existing Chat03B1 workflow retains SQLite CAS and local Wrangler/D1 checks.\n- `gameplay-server/PRIVATE_ALPHA_TWO_PERSON_ACCESS_SPEC.md` records that operator generation/status readback is implemented and tested only in local source. It is not deployed; operator custody/recovery approval and hosted unknown-generation recovery remain BLOCKED / STOP.\n- PR #459's `AGENTS.md`, `.codex/config.toml`, and agent role files are present from current main.\n\n## Integration defects fixed\n\n- A session-scoped monotonic version gate prevents a late local-harness GET from rolling back a newer POST view.\n- Remote manual reconnect and auto-restore no longer attribute a stale pending selection to an already committed server move; the original command identity remains available for reconciliation.\n- Local harness retries after an uncertain network result reuse the original commandId and immutable selection.\n\n## Exact-head validation\n\nHEAD: `34ca74356cc930a505be49562fa0dea3e4cb8ad6`.\n\n- Chat 03B2 Private Gameplay API run [40907765644](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/40907765644): SUCCESS, including syntax, remote-client regressions, offline D1 safety, two-player harness tests, and isolated local Worker/workerd/D1 integration.\n- Chat 03B1 Gameplay CAS SQL run [40907765647](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/40907765647): SUCCESS, including SQLite CAS/rollback and Wrangler/local-D1 checks.\n- AI Forensics run [40907765618](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/40907765618): SUCCESS.\n- Independent `critical_reviewer`: `PASS_STATIC_AND_TARGETED_PROBES` on this exact HEAD; no open material findings.\n- GitHub PR-patch whitespace scan: no added trailing whitespace.\n\n## Boundaries\n\nNo main merge, Cloudflare resource changes, hosted D1, deployment, credentials, real-person invitation, production, Stage 7.15, Chat04/05, or telemetry changes. CI's Worker/D1 evidence is local integration only. No hosted, physical Safari, or two-device acceptance is claimed.",
